# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Your real material. Never committed.
#
# profile/ holds your CV, your stories and your guardrails. That is personal
# data: phone numbers, employer detail, and candid notes you would not publish.
# The repo ships profile.example/ instead, which is fictional and safe.
#
# If you are reading this because you want to share your profile with someone:
# don't do it by committing. Send the files.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
